---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="How this M.M. Construction & Consults website handles enquiry details sent by email or WhatsApp, and external services.">
<PageHero label="Privacy policy" title="Your enquiry. Your choice." text="How information is handled when you use this website or contact our team."/>
<section class="section"><div class="container legal"><p>This policy describes the enquiry features provided on the M.M. Construction & Consults website.</p><h2>Information you choose to share</h2><p>The enquiry form asks for your name, mobile number, service requirement, project location, message, and an optional email address. These details are used only to respond to your enquiry.</p><h2>Email enquiries</h2><p>When you choose Send Enquiry, the details you entered are sent to our inbox ({site.email}) through FormSubmit (formsubmit.co), an email-forwarding service that processes the submission under its own privacy terms. The website itself does not store your enquiry in a database.</p><h2>WhatsApp enquiries</h2><p>If you choose Send via WhatsApp instead, the form creates a WhatsApp link containing the information you entered and opens WhatsApp. You choose whether to send that message.</p><p>Your enquiry information is passed to WhatsApp through the link when you open it. WhatsApp processes information under its own privacy terms. Share only the details needed for an initial project conversation; avoid sensitive personal documents.</p><h2>Website storage and analytics</h2><p>This website’s frontend does not use an enquiry database, advertising trackers, analytics scripts, or browser storage for the form. The hosting provider may process technical request information, such as IP addresses and browser details, as part of serving the website.</p><h2>Embedded map</h2><p>The contact page embeds a Google Maps view of our office location. When it loads, Google may receive technical information from your browser under its own privacy terms.</p><h2>External links</h2><p>Instagram, Facebook, and WhatsApp links take you to services operated by other providers. Their privacy practices and terms apply when you use them.</p><h2>Questions about an enquiry</h2><p>If you need to discuss information you shared with the company, please contact the team on <a class="text-link" href={site.phones[0].href}>{site.phones[0].label}</a> or email <a class="text-link" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p></div></section>
</Layout>
